invalid type: string "RECIPE 200  |  DRINKS, SMOOTHIES & FROZEN TREATS\nMixed Berry Sorbet\nSmooth dairy-free sorbet with berries, lemon, sugar, and a pinch of salt.\nPREP\n5-15 min\nCOOK\n0-10 min\nSERVES\n4\nLEVEL\nEasy\nINGREDIENTS\nMETHOD\n-\n2 cups frozen mixed berries\n-\n3 cups water\n-\n1/3 cup simple syrup\n-\n1/4 cup lemon juice\n-\n1 tsp vanilla extract\n-\npinch of fine salt\n-\nate\n-